+   - สร้าง src/controllers/taskController.js และ src/routes/taskRoutes.js (จัดการ CRUD ของ Tasks / Activities)
+   - ใช้ Promise Wrappers สำหรับ sqlite3 ในทุก Controller
+
+3. ลงทะเบียน Endpoints ใน server.js:
+   - เพิ่ม app.use('/api/cases', caseRoutes)
+   - เพิ่ม app.use('/api/tasks', taskRoutes)

# 2026-09-19 09:50:10.689766
+Implement Phase 4 Backend (Service Cloud & Activity Management):
+
+1. Update `src/config/database.js`:
+   - Create `cases` table: (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT, account_id INTEGER, contact_id INTEGER, subject TEXT, priority TEXT, status TEXT, created_at DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
+   - Create `tasks` table: (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT, title TEXT, due_date TEXT, status TEXT, deal_id INTEGER, account_id INTEGER, created_at DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
+
+2. Create Controllers & Routes:
+   - Create `src/controllers/caseController.js` and `src/routes/caseRoutes.js` (CRUD for cases)
+   - Create `src/controllers/taskController.js` and `src/routes/taskRoutes.js` (CRUD for tasks)
+   - Wrap sqlite3 database queries with Promises (async/await)
+
+3. Update `server.js`:
+   - Import caseRoutes and taskRoutes
+   - Register routes: `app.use('/api/cases', caseRoutes)` and `app.use('/api/tasks', taskRoutes)`

